AE2 Convenience Features

The mod's feature code, version adaptations and project documentation were written by AI.
zeroCNM provided requirements and testing feedback.

Functional design and implementation approaches reference:
- AE2 Auto Pattern Upload: https://github.com/GaLicn/AE2-Auto-Pattern-Upload
- EAEP / ExtendedAE Plus: https://github.com/GaLicn/ExtendedAE_Plus

This is a standalone implementation. Neither referenced mod is a runtime dependency.
No ExtendedAE_Plus class or method has been copied.

